            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.88</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>VoiceClaw Companion 0.1.88</h2><ul><li>Improves Companion Realtime Voice streaming startup reliability by queuing WebSocket messages until the socket is open.</li><li>Adds Kokoro/MLX local TTS support when the managed HF runtime is available, with Piper fallback.</li><li>Filters placeholder/noise transcripts such as [BLANK_AUDIO], [no audio], [typing sounds], and one-word "you" before they reach the middle brain.</li><li>Improves Companion Realtime Voice iPhone-tool routing for Calendar, mute, middle-brain switching, Cerebras model switching, and OpenClaw handoff.</li></ul>
]]></description>
