            <description><![CDATA[<h2>VoiceClaw Companion 0.1.87</h2><ul><li>Improves Companion Realtime Voice reliability when iOS commits a VAD turn immediately after sending audio.</li><li>Waits briefly for in-flight WebSocket audio frames before reporting an empty committed turn.</li><li>Uses the notarized GitHub DMG update path for this release.</li></ul>
]]></description>
